text = "Germs snuck in through a wound. Rude.

Place immune cells along the vessels to zap them before they reach your Core.

• Click glowing orbs for RP — your recruitment budget.
• Support cells don't fight, they hype up whoever's next to them.
• \"Wave incoming\" means duck — every lane gets rushed at once.

Body Health hits zero, it's game over. Don't. Go be a hero cell."

